[[FSE STAGE type=proscenium width=10 depth=8 units=m]]
[[FSE ENTITY door type=entrance pos=5,0]]
[[FSE ENTITY alex type=cast]]
[[FSE ENTITY bag type=prop]]
[[FSE ENTITY coat type=prop]]

INT. FLAT

Empty.

[[FSE ENTER alex from=door pos=2,0; SET bag with=alex; SET coat with=alex]]

Alex comes in with a bag and a coat.

[[FSE SET bag pos=alex by=alex]]

He drops the bag.

[[FSE SET coat pos=bag by=alex]]

And the coat by it.
